{"product_id":"lx1-4-bank-charger-cradle","title":"LX1 Charger Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cimg\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eKeep your team powered for the day with this high-efficiency multi-charger for the Vuzix LX1 7000 mAh battery. Capable of charging up to four batteries simultaneously, each charging slot features a clear LED light indicator, so you always know when batteries are ready for use. This reliable charging solution ensures your devices stay operational throughout the workday.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIncludes 4 bank charger, AC\/DC adapter, AC power cord (115V 60HZ Type A), and user manual.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe rated charger input is 12VDC 4A, output is 4.2VDC 2A.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe charger must be used with included Vuzix approved UL Listed AC adapter model ADP-48GR.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Vuzix Corporation","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":56409393037478,"sku":"516T0A020","price":199.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/DSC00380.jpg?v=1776348078","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/lx1-4-bank-charger-cradle","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}